731 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 226 0 R
/T (TerraLoopApp does not implement waste logic itself; it composes the other classes and coordinates them. WasteManager supplies records to WasteAnalyzer, WasteAnalyzer's output is passed to RecommendationEngine to generate suggestions, and SustainabilitySimulator reuses WasteAnalyzer's own calculation methods on a modified copy of the data rather than duplicating that logic. This collaboration between focused classes, rather than one large class doing everything, is the core OOP contribution of the project.)
/E (TerraLoopApp does not implement waste logic itself; it composes the other classes and coordinates them. WasteManager supplies records to WasteAnalyzer, WasteAnalyzer's output is passed to RecommendationEngine to generate suggestions, and SustainabilitySimulator reuses WasteAnalyzer's own calculation methods on a modified copy of the data rather than duplicating that logic. This collaboration between focused classes, rather than one large class doing everything, is the core OOP contribution of the project.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
