1355 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 233 0 R
/T (TerraLoop was validated through manual functional testing using meaningful, hand-entered sample data covering all six categories, a mix of recycled and non-recycled entries, and a range of dates and weights. Each core feature was exercised directly through the interface and checked against the expected result. No automated unit-test suite has been built for this prototype; testing to date has been manual and feature-by-feature.)
/E (TerraLoop was validated through manual functional testing using meaningful, hand-entered sample data covering all six categories, a mix of recycled and non-recycled entries, and a range of dates and weights. Each core feature was exercised directly through the interface and checked against the expected result. No automated unit-test suite has been built for this prototype; testing to date has been manual and feature-by-feature.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [37]
>>
