3619 0 obj
<<
/Title (TerraLoopApp does not implement waste logic itself; it composes the other classes and coordinates them. WasteManager supplies records to WasteAnalyzer, WasteAnalyzer's output is passed to RecommendationEngine to generate suggestions, and SustainabilitySimulator reuses WasteAnalyzer's own calculation methods on a modified copy of the data rather than duplicating that logic. This collaboration between focused classes, rather than one large class doing everything, is the core OOP contribution of the project.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3599 0 R
>>
endobj
